{
  "name": "Elemental Manipulator",
  "type": "archetypes",
  "img": "icons/svg/statue.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>Energies are yours to command and flow, sometimes through your own body.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to an Elemental/Energy power. If you already have an Elemental/Energy power, you can skip it, add a different Elemental/Energy power, or swap the die with one of your new dice.</p><p>Assign one of the remaining dice to one of these powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.RECkAlMY7v9N4KNI]{Absorption}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.5GDEdsr0jrDmWApP]{Flight}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fBd3ZqSIUowckCHO]{Leaping}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.I7Gr7LIRFGAzC1NE]{Swimming}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.MCfvbWF3GUPDWbLz]{Transmutation}</p><p>• Select from Elemental/Energy powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.brt7V1SXffIWpPTl]{Magical Lore}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.yfrz6TSCgB2EzH4E]{Science}</p><p>• Select from Mental qualities category</p><p>• Select from Physical qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of the following Green abilities, both of which must use your Elemental/Energy powers:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.HLsEHPAxBt2q78Ol]{Backlash}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.SKyLBo1yktnogTy8]{Energy Conversion}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.EDGW1MueeJEwYTsB]{External Combustion}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.XskL1ZLzKP8RlmMt]{Focused Apparatus}</li></ul><p>Gain one of these Yellow abilities, using one of your Elemental/Energy powers:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.sF39J1l3x2medB9g]{Damage Spike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.mIzjvha9oKYzYKpF]{Energy Alignment}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.4Sh1XZWusiEAIFhH]{Energy Redirection}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.7wLas1GwhrDcDVkI]{Live Dangerously}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Esoteric principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
  },
